    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Federal regulations require passengers to review\nthis important information for their safety.\nL-1011\nTristar\nCabin Safete\nSécurité\nSicherheit\nSeguridad\nHAWALAN.\nThe Colors of Paradise.\nCARD SAFETY L1011\nplease do not remove card from aircraft",
