      "ASSESS OUTSIDE BEFORE OPENING EXI1\nalla\n5\nEXIT\nEXIT!\nEXIT\nEmergency exit\nSortie de secours\nNotausgang\nUscita di emergenza\nSalida de urgencia\nspal alla\n*4P9\nASSESS OUTSIDE BEFORE OPENING EXIT\nK*?*EX\n5\nSLIDE/RAFT\n1\n6000 Y\n2\n6\n2\nEXIT\n3\nEXIT\n5"
